VITE_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8080/ws
# The ignition price (the header's Open) comes from the venue's GET /market/ignition (P16-3).
# The Alpaca credentials are backend settings now: ALPACA_KEY_ID and ALPACA_SECRET_KEY in the
# venue's environment (Windows user scope locally, credo.env on the server). Nothing here or in
# vite.config.ts reads them. The bots still read them from .env.local until P16-5.
